an>Introduction</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Understanding smart pet care</h2></div><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><p>Consistency is the foundation of animal wellbeing, and consistency is precisely what modern human schedules destroy. Late feeds, missed water changes and an overheated conservatory in July are ordinary household failures with real health consequences.</p><p>Smart Pet Care automates the routine so the routine actually happens, and measures it so you can prove it did.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-8 sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">The problem</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">Routine care fails in small, invisible ways</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Nobody intends to feed two hours late or leave a water fountain unfilled. But over a year, small lapses accumulate into measurable weight, hydration and stress effects.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Irregular feeding times disrupt digestion and increase begging and anxiety behaviours.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Water intake is almost never measured, despite being a key renal indicator.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Indoor temperature swings affect brachycephalic and long-coated animals disproportionately.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Multi-pet homes rarely know who ate what.</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-primary p-8 text-primary-foreground sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Our solution</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">Connected, measured, automated daily care</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Feeders, fountains, climate sensors and door systems operate on a schedule that adapts to your pet's actual needs, and every event is logged into the same health record as the monitoring platform.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Portion-accurate feeding tied to the nutrition plan.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Hydration measured to the millilitre, per animal.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Climate alerts before a room becomes dangerous.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Full integration with health monitoring and reporting.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Benefits</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">What you get out of it</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-co